// The other spelling of t_dc1d92b0: a float variable initialised from an
// int literal, used as a constructor component.  `float x = 1;` leaves an
// int constant behind, so the constructor it feeds did not fold either.
// One fix in the constructor fold covers both.
void main(out float4 oColor : COLOR)
{
    float x = 1;
    oColor = float4(0.5f, 0.25f, 0.125f, x);
}
